    "title": "No a la guerra | Spanish to English Translation - SpanishDictionary.com",
    "text": "no a la guerraNo a la guerra.No to war.Add to listPopularity500+ learners.ClosePowered By 1010 ShareNextStay DictionaryExamplesNo a la guerra.A phrase is a group of words commonly used together (e.g., once upon a time).phrase1. (general)a. No to war. Esta noche, miles de manifestantes salieron a las calles con estandartes que decían: \"No a la guerra.\"Tonight, thousands of demonstrators took to the streets carrying signs that said \"No to war.\"Copyright © 2026 Dictionary Media Group, Inc.ExamplesExamples have not been reviewed.no to war (26)war (18)no to the war (3)not to war (3)no war (2)Decimos no a la guerra y a sus preparativos.We say no to war and its preparations.Por lo tanto, deberíamos decir no a la guerra y confiar en la ONU.We should therefore say no to war and trust the UN.El futuro es de quienes contribuyen a la paz y no a la guerra.The future belongs to those who promote peace, not war.Me refiero a la batalla, no a la guerra.That is, the battle, not the war.También The New York Times ha decidido decir no a la guerra.The New York Times, too, has chosen to say no to war.No cabe duda de que eso llevará a la paz y no a la guerra.That will certainly lead to peace and not war.Pero no a la guerra.Not to a war.Señor Presidente, delante de mí hay un cartel que dice «no a la guerra».Mr President, I have a poster in front of me here which says no to war.Recuerda, no a la guerra.Make love, not war.¡Habrá algo más hermoso que una ciudad que se levanta para decir no a la guerra!How wonderful it is to see a city that stands up to refuse to go at war!More examplesRandom WordRoll the dice and learn a new word now!Get a WordWant to Learn Spanish?Spanish learning for everyone. For free.TranslationThe world’s largest Spanish dictionaryConjugationConjugations for every Spanish verbVocabularyLearn vocabulary fasterGrammarLearn every rule and exceptionPronunciationNative-speaker video pronunciationsWord of the Dayla alergiaallergyEarn an A+ in Spanish with Prem